UGH FEBRUARY 23, 2021 (THE "CLASS PERIOD"). THE LAWSUIT FILED IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK ALLEGES VIOLATIONS OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934.'}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2021-03-16 18:43:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES SHAREHOLDERS OF LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF MAY 3, 2021 - LDOS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - MARCH 16, 2021) - THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT IS BEING ISSUED BY LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP:TO: ALL PERSONS OR ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED SECURITIES OF LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. ("LEIDOS HOLDINGS") (NYSE: LDOS) BETWEEN MAY 4, 2020 AND FEBRUARY 23, 2021. YOU ARE HEREBY NOTIFIED THAT A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK. TO GET...'}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2021-03-16 09:39:00', 'title': 'KESSLER TOPAZ MELTZER & CHECK, LLP: SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION FILED AGAINST LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC.', 'text': 'RADNOR, PENNSYLVANIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - MARCH 16, 2021) - THE LAW FIRM OF KESSLER TOPAZ MELTZER & CHECK, LLP ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. (NYSE: LDOS) ("LEIDOS") ON BEHALF OF THOSE WHO PURCHASED OR ACQUIRED LEIDOS SECURITIES BETWEEN MAY 4, 2020 AND FEBRUARY 23, 2021, INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD").INVESTOR DEADLINE REMINDER: INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED OR ACQUIRED LEIDOS SECURITIES DURING THE CLASS PERIOD MAY, NO...'}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-03-16 06:45:00', 'title': "LILLY'S MIRIKIZUMAB HELPS PATIENTS ACHIEVE CLINICAL REMISSION AND IMPROVES SYMPTOMS IN ADULTS WITH ULCERATIVE COLITIS IN 12-WEEK PHASE 3 INDUCTION STUDY", 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS, MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT MIRIKIZUMAB MET THE PRIMARY AND ALL KEY SECONDARY ENDPOINTS IN LUCENT-1, A 12-WEEK PHASE 3 INDUCTION STUDY EVALUATING THE EFFICACY AND SAFETY OF MIRIKIZUMAB FOR THE TREATMENT OF PATIENTS WITH MODERATE TO SEVERE ULCERATIVE COLITIS (UC). LUCENT-2, A MULTICENTER, RANDOMIZED, DOUBLE-BLIND, PLACEBO-CONTROLLED MAINTENANCE STUDY OF MIRIKIZUMAB IN PATIENTS WHO HAVE COMPLETED THE 12-WEEK LUCENT-1 INDUCTION STUDY IS ONGOING.'}{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2021-03-16 09:00:00', 'title': 'KONICHIWA OSAKA! W HOTELS DEBUTS IN JAPAN WITH THE OPENING OF W OSAKA', 'text': "OSAKA, JAPAN, MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE WAIT IS OVER.\xa0W HOTELS WORLDWIDE, PART OF MARRIOTT BONVOY'S PORTFOLIO OF 30 EXTRAORDINARY BRANDS, TODAY LIFTED THE CURTAINS ON JAPAN'S FIRST-EVER\xa0W HOTEL."}{'symbol': 'MCK', 'date': '2021-03-16 10:00:00', 'title': 'MCKESSON EXPANDS INTEGRATED PHARMACY SERVICES FOR SPECIALTY CLINICS', 'text': 'IRVING, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MCKESSON ANNOUNCES A COLLABORATION WITH VANDERBILT HEALTH RX SOLUTIONS (VHRXS), A NATIONAL LEADER IN SPECIALTY PHARMACY STRATEGY AND IMPLEMENTATION.'}{'symbol': 'MRK', 'date': '2021-03-16 03:00:00', 'title': 'MERCK KGAA, DARMSTADT, GERMANY, REPORTS TOPLINE DATA FOR BINTRAFUSP ALFA AS SECOND-LINE MONOTHERAPY TREATMENT IN BILIARY TRACT CANCER', 'text': 'NOT INTENDED FOR UK-BASED MEDIA \xa0 DARMSTADT, GERMANY, MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MERCK KGAA, DARMSTADT, GERMANY, A LEADING SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED TOPLINE DATA FROM THE PHASE II INTR@PID BTC 047 STUDY EVALUATING BINTRAFUSP ALFA AS A MONOTHERAPY IN THE SECOND-LINE TREATMENT OF PATIENTS WITH LOCALLY ADVANCED OR METASTATIC BILIARY TRACT CANCER (BTC) WHO HAVE FAILED OR ARE INTOLERANT OF FIRST-LINE PLATINUM-BASED CHEMOTHERAPY. IN THE STUDY OF 159 PATIENTS, BINTRAFUSP ALFA DEMONSTRATED SINGLE-AGENT EFFICACY AND DURABILITY WITH A MANAGEABLE SAFETY PROFILE AFTER MORE THAN NINE MONTHS OF FOLLOW-UP, WITH AN INDEPENDENT REVIEW COMMITTEE (IRC)-ADJUDICATED OBJECTIVE RESPONSE RATE (ORR) OF 10.1% (95% CI: 5.9% TO 15.8%) PER RECIST 1.1.'}{'symbol': 'MU', 'date': '2021-03-16 16:30:00', 'title': 'MICRON UPDATES DATA CENTER PORTFOLIO STRATEGY TO ADDRESS GROWING OPPORTUNITY FOR MEMORY AND STORAGE HIERARCHY INNOVATION', 'text': "BOISE, IDAHO, MARCH 16, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MICRON TECHNOLOGY, INC. (NASDAQ: MU), TODAY ANNOUNCED UPDATES TO THE COMPANY'S PORTFOLIO STRATEGY TO FURTHER STRENGTHEN ITS FOCUS ON MEMORY AND STORAGE INNOVATIONS FOR THE DATA CENTER. MICRON WILL INCREASE INVESTMENT IN NEW MEMORY PRODUCTS THAT LEVERAGE THE COMPUTE EXPRESS LINK™ (CXL™), THE RECENTLY INTRODUCED INDUSTRY STANDARD INTERFACE THAT ENABLES FLEXIBLE CONNECTION BETWEEN COMPUTE, MEMORY AND STORAGE. WITH IMMEDIATE EFFECT, MICRON WILL CEASE DEVELOPMENT OF 3D XPOINT™ AND SHIFT RESOURCES TO FOCUS ON ACCELERATING MARKET INTRODUCTION OF CXL-ENABLED MEMORY PRODUCTS."}{'symbol': 'MSFT', 'date': '2021-03-16 16:05:00', 'title': 'MICROSOFT ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'REDMOND, WASH., MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MICROSOFT CORP. ON TUESDAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.56 PER SHARE.'}{'symbol': 'MRNA', 'date': '2021-03-16 06:59:00', 'title': 'MODERNA ANNOUNCES FIRST PARTICIPANTS DOSED IN PHASE 2/3 STUDY OF COVID-19 VACCINE CANDIDATE IN PEDIATRIC POPULATION', 'text': 'CAMBRIDGE, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MODERNA ANNOUNCES THE FIRST PARTICIPANTS HAVE BEEN DOSED IN THE PHASE 2/3 STUDY OF ITS COVID-19 VACCINE CANDIDATE IN THE PEDIATRIC POPULATION.'}{'symbol': 'MCO', 'date': '2021-03-16 08:30:00', 'title': "MOODY'S ANALYTICS WINS ANALYTICS INNOVATION AWARD FOR CRE SOLUTION", 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MOODY'S ANALYTICS HAS WON THE ANALYTICS INNOVATION CATEGORY IN THE 2021 FINTECH BREAKTHROUGH AWARDS. WE EARNED THIS AWARD FOR INNOVATION IN OUR COMMERCIAL REAL ESTATE (CRE) OFFERING. SPECIFICALLY RECOGNIZED WAS OUR CUSTOM MARKETS MODEL, WHICH GIVES CUSTOMERS THE ABILITY TO CREATE UNIQUE, CUSTOMIZED SUBMARKETS OF COMMERCIAL AND MULTIFAMILY PROPERTIES. “WINNING A FINTECH BREAKTHROUGH AWARD FOR OUR INNOVATION IN THE CRE SPACE IS REALLY EXCITING,” SAID KEITH BERRY, GENERA"}{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2021-03-16 06:59:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ TO DELIVER EXECUTION PLATFORM TECHNOLOGY TO PURESTREAM', 'text': 'THE FULLY-HOSTED MARKET INFRASTRUCTURE TECHNOLOGY WILL SUPPORT THE NEW U.S. TRADING VENUE WHICH REENGINEERS THE PRICE AND LIQUIDITY DISCOVERY PROCESS, BY FOCUSING ON PARENT ORDER COMPLETION SPEEDS, NOT PER TRADE LATENCY'}{'symbol': 'NTAP', 'date': '2021-03-16 10:00:00', 'title': 'NETAPP OVERHAULS GLOBAL SALES ORGANIZATION TO ACCELERATE CLOUD-LED GROWTH', 'text': 'SUNNYVALE, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LESS THAN A YEAR AFTER JOINING GLOBAL SOFTWARE LEADER NETAPP (NASDAQ: NTAP) AS ITS PRESIDENT, CÉSAR CERNUDA HAS ANNOUNCED CHANGES TO THE GO-TO-MARKET (GTM) MODEL AND GLOBAL SALES ORGANIZATION THAT WILL HELP STEER THE COMPANY INTO ITS CLOUD-LED FUTURE. CERNUDA IS INSTITUTING A CUSTOMER- AND PARTNER-CENTRIC STRATEGIC AND OPERATIONAL EVOLUTION THAT WILL ALLOW NETAPP TO MOVE TO A CUSTOMER ENGAGEMENT MODEL FOCUSED ON DRIVING DEEPER SPECIALIZATION AND DELIVERING HY'}{'symbol': 'NLSN', 'date': '2021-03-16 05:00:00', 'title': 'SPANISH BROADCASTING SYSTEM SIGNS MULTI-YEAR AGREEMENT WITH NIELSEN AUDIO', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, NIELSEN (NYSE: NLSN) ANNOUNCED THAT SPANISH BROADCASTING SYSTEM (SBS) HAS ENTERED INTO A LONG-TERM AGREEMENT FOR NIELSEN AUDIO SERVICES. THIS MULTI-YEAR RENEWAL INCLUDES A CONTINUATION OF THEIR AUDIO AUDIENCE MEASUREMENT LICENSES ACROSS ALL FIVE PPM MARKETS AND THE DIARY MARKET OF PUERTO RICO.'}{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2021-03-16 16:20:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE DECLARES COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND., MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF 22 CENTS PER SHARE, PAYABLE MAY 20, 2021 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON APRIL 30, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'NDSN', 'date': '2021-03-16 22:30:00', 'title': 'NORDSON ELECTRONICS SOLUTIONS TO SHOWCASE PRINTED CIRCUIT BOARD ASSEMBLY AND SEMICONDUCTOR PACKAGING EQUIPMENT AT PRODUCTRONICA CHINA AND SEMICON CHINA TRADE SHOWS', 'text': 'CARLSBAD, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NORDSON ELECTRONICS SOLUTIONS TO SHOWCASE ELECTRONICS MANUFACTURING AND SEMICONDUCTOR PACKAGING EQUIPMENT AT PRODUCTRONICA CHINA AND SEMICON CHINA.'}{'symbol': 'NDSN', 'date': '2021-03-16 08:30:00', 'title': 'NORDSON TO HOST VIRTUAL INVESTOR DAY ON MARCH 30, 2021', 'text': 'WESTLAKE, OHIO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NORDSON TO HOST VIRTUAL INVESTOR DAY ON MARCH 30, 2021'}{'symbol': 'NCLH', 'date': '2021-03-16 09:02:00', 'title': 'OCEANIA CRUISES WELCOMES "VISTA" TO ITS ACCLAIMED FLEET', 'text': "MIAMI, MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 OCEANIA CRUISES , THE WORLD'S LEADING CULINARY- AND DESTINATION-FOCUSED CRUISE LINE, INTRODUCED VISTA \xa0TO THE WORLD TODAY, NAMING THE FIRST OF TWO NEW 1,200-GUEST ALLURA CLASS SHIPS THAT ARE BEING CONSTRUCTED BY RENOWNED ITALIAN SHIPBUILDER FINCANTIERI S.P.A. THE LUXURY VESSEL, THE SEVENTH FOR THE LINE, WILL SET SAIL IN 2023, FOLLOWED BY A SISTER SHIP IN 2025."}{'symbol': 'NUE', 'date': '2021-03-16 09:00:00', 'title': 'NUCOR EXPECTS RECORD QUARTERLY EARNINGS IN THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2021', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NUCOR CORPORATION (NYSE: NUE) TODAY ANNOUNCED GUIDANCE FOR ITS FIRST QUARTER ENDING APRIL 3, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2021-03-16 09:00:00', 'title': "THE NEW ESSENTIALS: A YEAR INTO THE PANDEMIC, WE AREN'T 'RETURNING' TO WORK -WE'RE REDEFINING IT", 'text': 'NEW YORK, MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AFTER A YEAR OF COVID-19 AND ITS EFFECTS ON WORK, A NEW STUDY BY GLOBAL COMMUNICATIONS CONSULTANCY KETCHUM SHOWS THAT MORE THAN TWO-THIRDS (70%) OF EMPLOYED AMERICANS SAY THEY ARE MORE LIKELY TO STAY AT THEIR CURRENT JOBS THAN THEY WERE BEFORE THE PANDEMIC. BUT WITH BOTH FRONTLINE AND NON-FRONTLINE WORKERS EXPERIENCING HIGH LEVELS OF BURNOUT AS A RESULT OF THE PANDEMIC, THE STUDY REVEALS DRAMATIC SHIFTS IN WHAT PEOPLE WANT FROM THEIR EMPLOYERS.'}{'symbol': 'OKE', 'date': '2021-03-16 09:00:00', 'title': 'ONEOK TO PARTICIPATE IN MIZUHO ENERGY SUMMIT', 'text': 'TULSA, OKLA., MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ONEOK, INC. (NYSE: OKE) WILL PARTICIPATE IN VIRTUAL INVESTOR MEETINGS AT THE MIZUHO ENERGY SUMMIT ON MARCH 16, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2021-03-16 11:00:00', 'title': 'ORACLE ANNOUNCES JAVA 16', 'text': 'AUSTIN, TEXAS, MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY ORACLE ANNOUNCED THE AVAILABILITY OF JAVA 16 (ORACLE JDK 16), INCLUDING 17 NEW ENHANCEMENTS TO THE PLATFORM THAT WILL FURTHER IMPROVE DEVELOPER PRODUCTIVITY. THE LATEST JAVA DEVELOPMENT KIT (JDK) FINALIZED PATTERN MATCHING FOR INSTANCEOF (JEP 394) AND RECORDS (JEP 395), LANGUAGE ENHANCEMENTS THAT WERE FIRST PREVIEWED IN JAVA 14.'}{'symbol': 'QCOM', 'date': '2021-03-16 09:01:00', 'title': 'QUALCOMM COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF NUVIA', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0QUALCOMM INCORPORATED (NASDAQ: QCOM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS SUBSIDIARY, QUALCOMM TECHNOLOGIES, INC., HAS COMPLETED ITS ACQUISITION OF THE WORLD-CLASS CPU AND TECHNOLOGY DESIGN COMPANY, NUVIA FOR $1.4 BILLION BEFORE WORKING CAPITAL AND OTHER ADJUSTMENTS. "THE WORLD-CLASS NUVIA TEAM ENHANCES OUR CPU ROADMAP, EXTENDING QUALCOMM\'S LEADING TECHNOLOGY POSITION WITH THE WINDOWS, ANDROID AND CHROME ECOSYSTEMS," SAID CRISTIANO AMON, PRESIDENT AND CEO-ELECT, QUALCOMM INCORPORATED.'}{'symbol': 'RJF', 'date': '2021-03-16 16:33:00', 'title': "LISA DETANNA RANKED TO BARRON'S TOP 1,200 FINANCIAL ADVISORS LIST", 'text': "BEVERLY HILLS, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LISA A. DETANNA, AIF ®, MBA, WMS ® MANAGING DIRECTOR & SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, INVESTMENTS WITH RAYMOND JAMES & ASSOCIATES, MEMBER NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE/SIPC, WAS RECENTLY NAMED TO BARRON'S LIST OF THE TOP 1,200 FINANCIAL ADVISORS. THE PRESTIGIOUS 2021 LIST WAS PUBLISHED MARCH 14 AND DRAWS FROM ALL 50 STATES, PLUS THE DISTRICT OF COLUMBIA. “IT IS AN ABSOLUTE HONOR TO BE